  "ruleText": "Bar 301.06 Completion of Apprenticeship. The apprentice shall complete and file an application for licensure in accordance with Bar 301.07(b) upon completion of the apprenticeship.\n\nSource. #5308, eff 1-16-92; ss by #6046-b, eff 6-1-95; ss by #6577, eff 9-13-97; ss by #7555, eff 9-12-01; ss by #8655, eff 6-9-06, EXPIRED: 6-9-14\n\nNew. #10808, eff 4-2-15",
